# Day 39

**38km / 8.5 hours**

*Mangokewa North campsite to Ngaherenga campsite*

I walked on the road all day. The end 

To be serious that was basically the day but I could mention that it was absolutely frosty in the morning before being warm in the daytime. Other than that it was just long stretches on the road, some of it rarely used gravel roads, some of it a state highway, all of it pretty dull. 

![The snowy mountain visible in the distance. That's actually where I'm headed which is cool but also a little concerning.](./distant-mountain.avif)